 Outsourced Customer Service#Configure the Performance Analytics for the Outsourced Customer Service#Procedure#{8}":[413,422],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Configure the Performance Analytics for the Outsourced Customer Service#Procedure#{9}":[423,424],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Configure the Performance Analytics for the Outsourced Customer Service#Procedure#{10}":[425,426],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Configure the Performance Analytics for the Outsourced Customer Service#Procedure#{11}":[427,430],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Configure the Performance Analytics for the Outsourced Customer Service#Procedure#{12}":[431,432],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Configure the Performance Analytics for the Outsourced Customer Service#Procedure#{13}":[433,434],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Configure the Performance Analytics for the Outsourced Customer Service#Procedure#{14}":[435,436],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Related":[437,445],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Related#{1}":[439,439],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Related#{2}":[440,440],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Related#{3}":[441,441],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Related#{4}":[442,442],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Related#{5}":[443,443],"#Configure Outsourced Customer Service#Related#{6}":[444,445]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Outsourced Customer Service","target":"outsourced-service-provider","line":18},{"title":"Case Routing and Assignment","target":"case-routing-and-asign","line":95},{"title":"rules","target":"gamification-components-rules","line":102},{"title":"view cases","target":"osp-view-cases","line":111},{"title":"lists","target":"migration-lists","line":236},{"title":"Performance Analytics diagnostics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/self-diagnostics.md","line":397},{"title":"Outsourced Service Provider dashboard","target":"ocs-dashboard","line":413},{"title":"Outsourced Customer Service","target":"outsourced-service-provider","line":439},{"title":"Case routing and assignment","target":"case-routing-and-asign","line":440},{"title":"Rules","target":"gamification-components-rules","line":441},{"title":"View cases","target":"osp-view-cases","line":442},{"title":"Lists","target":"migration-lists","line":443},{"title":"Outsourced Service Provider dashboard","target":"ocs-dashboard","line":444}],"metadata":{"title":"Configure Outsourced Customer Service","description":"Configure various components of Outsourced Customer Service based on the specific requirements of your organization.Configure various aspects of Outsourced Customer Service based on the specific requirements of your organization.OSP managers and agents view cases based on the defined outsourced criteria. Defining outsourcing criteria can be based on account, asset, consumer, or sold product. For example, consumer-based criteria could be defined for all Spanish speaking consumers and all consumers based out of Australia.An administrator creates groups and associates it to an OSP. This group is the default group to which the case is assigned to when an OSP agent transfers the unresolved case back to an enterprise.An administrator creates Outsourced Service Providers \\(OSPs\\) after which OSP managers and agents must be onboarded to manage and fulfill cases. As an administrator you can onboard both the OSP managers and agents.An enterprise creates Outsourced Service Providers \\(OSPs\\) to provide customer service to external customers.Run diagnostics, review and customize components, and start collecting data.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/customer-service-management/configure-outsourced-cust-serv.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":8,"breadcrumb":["Outsourced Customer Service","Extend capabilities","Configure","Custome